  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbf17dc004883244a6b0db3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……嗯～总觉得今天的心情，\r\n反而感到相当平静耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "220b134339a2aabec71799b962ed79e35d4bacd2797dc357548d5750aed1a2a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36744e936abf470f4114cce7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都太神了～！\r\n像这样大爆冷门，\r\n未免太青春了吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c0fbdd4143c83449833178a20046ee5a18206bbf9b5a3f47eec30a0314e6d14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92cfdde3f3973db8026721ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂喂～！\r\n训练员，别这么消沉！\r\n我还能继续跑呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f5bc8d38fa74606257b89b0750357da244c6e6666c04e6c78176e978fca912e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e51ec917870d740da89788f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧上吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1127d3f9a93a4bda2203c67b1431362e01c63b1927d2ad4c61de3333840cf7ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a98991fa607339c7f409e63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨起来吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a4a1e6f2b1bddb84b164c81b3ad33e64c4d66371266e0ef6572d2f3a5c17a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d8f56ce46aa060542fe9c2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶喔耶～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8572b7b6bb89b8fa63289ae72aeb69f0d1543c91b9111298d23f08fdc143bdec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e59a5d460ce0b6203e208bd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超强耶～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc26cb6ffc664574cdb47540f1b160b6a5d9b87e01129f1c379eb3fe777981a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2924e45d078075aa806dde43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇──！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2b3a8cbd9e9924b0a2863b0bb78dd8450667bb48fd440e1802583b95918d7bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27f88721c0f4e5a7824837a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇塞──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e07ba71c3a46386b93db8ff131f046882776b0df3999bb592bbf905a0b8517b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f5644559d34d79d6bfc1962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f000228c5090e4d4073cbf17be3d7843f005dd4ef4b93a2271a668272d2d45a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f99098603a9c220d8a94c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是大海耶！嗨起来了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9e77d9a5cfce04e73ccc2867c210bc3d5a8913315dde36f4bf4dbf06d11c14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5d44f013e73f6336b2f4364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大感谢☆我们已经是挚友了吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c813bf09c8b2bbad161f82c0fde58c0d3f840fbc97115f84dcd3b8fea6d7f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e743db39d98e8b1546ef117",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小训训，辛苦啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "838fa5f89b99031f70cf4ddeab5e70211a6ddc0f819191b18c443d7076dc6b4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a8dfa8c8f011d03854a340c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还能继续提升吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d0ea18b47ff346ad0c88f87aa71edfc17411792feac7efd8868ca57a81f07b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4822556be6c46348c40bd123",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰，fu～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2fa5d166eab8698df2a44fade3b8cc4322c2deeac64129fe933cc3e7b77a52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751bd6f0b40566028e05a7de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶～好期待喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c30405e297f8c043476af97d3e7b5d7fb8f6558e123cef73b41f10b1b907dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c98c8d2a8e1ef58a62e7db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小训训，辛苦啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "838fa5f89b99031f70cf4ddeab5e70211a6ddc0f819191b18c443d7076dc6b4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d487132228017b53afa7b53a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜～～感觉整个人静不下来！\r\n该怎么形容？像在舞池里一样？\r\n兴奋期待抖啊抖啊抖～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb583ebb804878fd89102c142238d66adae3d17438e30b8310ef07f7047168b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f64ccbf2cff775866daa5072",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小训，谢啦！\r\n我现在超认真觉得自己不会输！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4529edc4112ae3023df1ca8a99119dd62aa77bb368704a9b79d99a75c90624f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf85432c70032fc1da12f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小训训，辛苦啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "838fa5f89b99031f70cf4ddeab5e70211a6ddc0f819191b18c443d7076dc6b4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a79dddfd05e787c68d08b8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おしゃおしゃ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dee4b8bead40a6756c7c2a15843d328b7bd911b4775dabb730e99b851b54e36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64b15653acd03260f4798978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太热血了吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1371860d4678b25f06b179abdb25d56c4a170d6243b4eb648d03c2485df1934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:654cdfa20fe6dbebccd1db0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想继续拚下去～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57b51ebc34b0de5cbd56ffdedddcbd80a71e2923c096d127e65cc2cdbb7f40de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ee974f1813f4b99849e84fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇～超难！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46400f42f6ad2f9ac49a907dc0ec22b2a014720e67ac3a7b94e7b31202fdeff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3137066b04bd1184a6134639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这游戏太难了吧！？天啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7de93b2a984812ee8f7fea00e3a491667eaf0618a6428740d5620edcbb09760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d4b21cb0fd1693753dc5295",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻～！\r\n简单来讲就是我最棒吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e6f3efa92e9bedb647eef61c441571d175e3a001269fd8434771f4c5a027077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af227830318274adc08b2249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样啊～！很帅气吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b69ac5e4963a9273c19a6357ae4e3ad4bf811313ac4fa2edf8a8be043839fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0863aeae5f76f7e501b750a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぇいうぇいー！\r\nリードはウチに、まかセロリ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f940f1c0d50dc323cd86dad728e76ba92f866ec4a7e2881dcb3c1f85c8c4a55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea866666e935943bb22c2d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どやどや～！イケメてっしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "251d294b881b4cdac98119298435df689a8d06f7ca3d19905bcc62beb3989613",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f53f3553cb7a1b2ae3e2b9cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轰隆隆隆隆～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ecb982b85b5055b5bc6c6d1691ae6ca55b8a6c0097780587bf1683b393648d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6307b9dfd06819ca394f48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "砰砰～！冲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd8e11e9db1036abb170cb1a3f647fc1f134a879ba958772e362dcd42897477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69faad65d3f4168939ad4464",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鬼アピったるべ～！逆に五七五とか\r\nありよりのあり！？ルビー色～\r\n吸い込まれそう♡らびゅすぎる♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "b83cfb39eb8fe1866df774cb4b3c900aa9329a0e3429aafbdb5ba5bc331085e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12af93c10a7178734e09b7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超热──☆太阳很嗨耶！\r\n只能比谁才是真正的玩咖啦！？\r\n太阳？太阳！太阳？太阳──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e687906e60aa7e4fe08aa35966e47718e8e9a03473be183ed9dcf81b1a44ccc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e88e508669b14d5be8f8d18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装的装饰真的让人很嗨呢☆\r\n果然跟好麻吉用同样的风格穿搭，\r\n能让人嗨到不行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a4597fefa9be7fe15bc839eb7c69cd75543ece4ce0f4255b8b0e5c01bcdc34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06f3b81c31ed9d7e34792e89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んへへへっ、お嬢とでぇと♡\r\nマジきゃぱぱ♡　しょーみ最強？？\r\n――ベスデ、ぜってー獲る！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0824695d33caf3efaf402be6fcb4ae65873f16e874a9a52c6689dc8423eccc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2e81a8a7589fa9aed49c451",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我不太懂！但先抬起头来吧？\r\n有我在！就会冒出笑容对吧☆\r\n只要有最强的我陪着就无敌啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "05786bac3bc57a32e3879a6f744473e0ee52382aa3d6b2ea6d9963c4b476d20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c01b360bb03321705ebfd34f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミラん！バンちゃむ！ゼファち！\r\nみんなサイコー！っぱフェスよな！\r\n…お嬢ともフェスれたち。にへ♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5194f681e8ed75455a8b58e52e95ca4bfd3c0251ee4d1d2635b9bab24a432e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4314c660984edb2ce07eb94a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶～！太阳在此☆\r\n尽情地大闹吧！然后呢～哇哈哈哈♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f90e431b6a6f4805dd3e792ea4fde2d45b05ac89d62b3e2622fd0c00054278b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:656ac559d39c811cb1f3415f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果祭典结束了，\r\n再嗨一波就可以了啊！\r\n明天和后天也都要继续嗨喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d1b6921ee99bb1f9ad407d7ede9e701b376ea314b17acf8cef24bfe7de3f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5fc4f8d8ecabd5091d70de2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最后的房间派对爆笑的～！\r\n我们吵到被骂整个超感动的笑死！\r\n好姐妹们，我们要一直在一起哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a325eb323369bb48bc5bb00aae96d65f7c5b4c859c03578a699cc6d029900016",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8dbaa2309950a4a8a19f239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瞧瞧活动任务喔耶喔耶～！\r\n你一定可以立刻秀一波对吧！？\r\n嗨起来吧死党大声喊出Fuu☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c8fc73ee4abdb6aa78c3b156c255936f362cdb612b152b79706c547730232a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d23e9d000d7296dfc7be707",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦～！真的该赞爆！\r\n女孩们都超棒！随便都很棒☆\r\n反正结束嗨起来一切就喔耶～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1f82e6ce45d1e64e959f4f8dcad399779c3b08aa9082bdb241d56ca36793cda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87a550368c79d29720cf8606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウチ！オンザステージ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd91ec3385ab8f429ef55c4bdcec5d7afdcea721bca49eb5578ae8a062990f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9108609b2f6ffa296b709236",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はい！ちゅーもく☆からのブーン！からのウィー！\r\nうはっ！ちゃんヘリ劇場・ただいま爆誕☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "608403d6fdcdbcc0d2cd2e497e9907d3156ff03835b7d2ea3ca635b06a804092",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "40004"
      ]
